                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcb7118b-8310-34c1-8463-832219ec9125",
                        "entry_id": "c296772f-679c-3abb-bfe4-112677f1ee9a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The feeling of being troubled; upset or anxiety."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "869e7e60-c27c-4802-919e-e0d3c3cb3146",
                                "sense_id": "dcb7118b-8310-34c1-8463-832219ec9125",
                                "text": "The Lord was with me, and I was not fearful of it; howbeit, it did cause great troublement and disturbance to many worthy people in my parish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b2ff7b6-1c38-44ce-b3e1-2b813f9d3720",
                                "sense_id": "dcb7118b-8310-34c1-8463-832219ec9125",
                                "text": "Troublement and emotion crackled just below the blanketing surface."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5939e4e2-8477-4c18-8353-bcdbdb0a2124",
                                "sense_id": "dcb7118b-8310-34c1-8463-832219ec9125",
                                "text": "In the later telling, this twenty-word description is internalized and greatly expanded, as the listener is invited to follow the action through Merrywise's thoughts and senses: \"He couldn't get to sleep, because he had all these troublements in his mind, and also because she snored."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97232530-3bf0-40f5-bc2c-b9b5c214a741",
                                "sense_id": "dcb7118b-8310-34c1-8463-832219ec9125",
                                "text": "Though some troublement and worriment was on his face."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06fa8332-7b36-3992-8495-7fd137ee7a49",
                        "entry_id": "c296772f-679c-3abb-bfe4-112677f1ee9a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A problem; something that causes trouble."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4939c32d-2827-4d87-9b79-350109b2ec08",
                                "sense_id": "06fa8332-7b36-3992-8495-7fd137ee7a49",
                                "text": "We have this confidence: that amidst all the travails, troublements, tragedies of this life, God invites us to build a strong, solid future for our families and friends, our community and our world."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15eb4a20-9d16-4b7d-9ec2-c7e7d7fd7975",
                                "sense_id": "06fa8332-7b36-3992-8495-7fd137ee7a49",
                                "text": "Well, weuns makes it by de goats widout any troublements an' finally comes to a road."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54f34092-2865-4d0b-8ebf-db95bbe127d8",
                                "sense_id": "06fa8332-7b36-3992-8495-7fd137ee7a49",
                                "text": "“Don't blame me;” I told them, “for all your troublements and woes: blame the island!'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
